(6842158, 1029694, 114225, '<td valign="top">The hue tint gives this a really cold feeling that plays nicely with the emptiness.</td>', 'The hue tint gives this a really cold feeling that plays nicely with the emptiness.', '2012-08-15 14:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842159, 1029795, 114225, '<td valign="top">This subject seems to have some great potential. I think if you concentrated more on the details and less on capturing the whole scene, this could have popped better.</td>', 'This subject seems to have some great potential. I think if you concentrated more on the details and less on capturing the whole scene, this could have popped better.', '2012-08-15 14:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842161, 1029647, 114225, '<td valign="top">The composition and use of depth of field here is stunning. I''m seeing a lot more purple tinting instead of blue, but it may be my monitor.</td>', 'The composition and use of depth of field here is stunning. I''m seeing a lot more purple tinting instead of blue, but it may be my monitor.', '2012-08-15 14:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842162, 1029774, 114225, '<td valign="top">That is some amazing reflection work.</td>', 'That is some amazing reflection work.', '2012-08-15 14:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842163, 1029728, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool find, and I like the inclusion of the evening sky colors. Too bad it''s basic editing, as this image could really benefit from some higher dynamic range.</td>', 'Very cool find, and I like the inclusion of the evening sky colors. Too bad it''s basic editing, as this image could really benefit from some higher dynamic range.', '2012-08-15 14:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842164, 1029706, 114225, '<td valign="top">Ha, what a wacky house. Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'Ha, what a wacky house. Thanks for sharing.', '2012-08-15 14:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842166, 1029801, 114225, '<td valign="top">The curve of this building is very cool. I''m seeing a lot of green  here, and almost no be, but it might be my monitor.</td>', 'The curve of this building is very cool. I''m seeing a lot of green  here, and almost no be, but it might be my monitor.', '2012-08-15 14:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842170, 1029469, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a cool way to spruce up Arnold building.</td>', 'Wow, what a cool way to spruce up Arnold building.', '2012-08-15 14:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842171, 1029680, 114225, '<td valign="top">Lovely choice in composition. The complimentary colors make a real statement.</td>', 'Lovely choice in composition. The complimentary colors make a real statement.', '2012-08-15 14:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842173, 1029740, 114225, '<td valign="top">iLife the building, but am not fond of the photo. The black part on the right and the heavy handed color adjustment are not pleasing to me.</td>', 'iLife the building, but am not fond of the photo. The black part on the right and the heavy handed color adjustment are not pleasing to me.', '2012-08-15 14:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842174, 1029420, 114225, '<td valign="top">What a magnificent structure, with so much interesting detail and color.</td>', 'What a magnificent structure, with so much interesting detail and color.', '2012-08-15 14:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842177, 1029664, 114225, '<td valign="top">I''m pretty sure Frank Lloyd Wright is rolling in his grave right now...</td>', 'I''m pretty sure Frank Lloyd Wright is rolling in his grave right now...', '2012-08-15 14:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842179, 1029136, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very  cool building.<br/> <br/>What''s up with that black corner?</td>', 'Very  cool building. What''s up with that black corner?', '2012-08-15 14:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842180, 1029845, 114225, '<td valign="top">It unfortunate that basic editing is hurting this image. This could use a bit more dynamic range and some lens correction (in my opinion).</td>', 'It unfortunate that basic editing is hurting this image. This could use a bit more dynamic range and some lens correction (in my opinion).', '2012-08-15 14:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842181, 1029473, 114225, '<td valign="top">Neely found and photographed.</td>', 'Neely found and photographed.', '2012-08-15 14:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842182, 1029840, 114225, '<td valign="top">What a cool piece of design. Nice capture.</td>', 'What a cool piece of design. Nice capture.', '2012-08-15 14:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842183, 1029458, 114225, '<td valign="top">So would throw stones at such a cool piece of urban art?</td>', 'So would throw stones at such a cool piece of urban art?', '2012-08-15 14:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842184, 1029676, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice. The yellow offsets really help bring out the blue.</td>', 'Nice. The yellow offsets really help bring out the blue.', '2012-08-15 14:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842185, 1029822, 114225, '<td valign="top">I was figuring we would see one of these. It''s definitely very nice, although I may have liked it even better with more focus on the curves and much less of the background.</td>', 'I was figuring we would see one of these. It''s definitely very nice, although I may have liked it even better with more focus on the curves and much less of the background.', '2012-08-15 14:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842186, 1029277, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Lovely bold colors and a great composition to highlight the structure.</td>', 'Very cool. Lovely bold colors and a great composition to highlight the structure.', '2012-08-15 14:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842190, 1029690, 114225, '<td valign="top">I find this photo incredibly inviting. I want to sit and study all of the curves and understand how the light flows.</td>', 'I find this photo incredibly inviting. I want to sit and study all of the curves and understand how the light flows.', '2012-08-15 14:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842191, 1029772, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wow, the contrast in here to accentuate the details is fantastic.</td>', 'Wow, the contrast in here to accentuate the details is fantastic.', '2012-08-15 14:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842192, 1029831, 114225, '<td valign="top">Lovely building on a lovely sky day. Too bad there isn''t a similar building on the right as there is on the left to give this symmetry.</td>', 'Lovely building on a lovely sky day. Too bad there isn''t a similar building on the right as there is on the left to give this symmetry.', '2012-08-15 14:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842193, 1029764, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice street image...except for the garbage pile.</td>', 'Nice street image...except for the garbage pile.', '2012-08-15 14:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842195, 1029696, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice once of city skyline, although I find myself wishing for less saturation and more contrast.</td>', 'Nice once of city skyline, although I find myself wishing for less saturation and more contrast.', '2012-08-15 14:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842197, 1029777, 114225, '<td valign="top">Lovely find. The sweeping curve through the image is very pleasing.</td>', 'Lovely find. The sweeping curve through the image is very pleasing.', '2012-08-15 14:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842224, 1029812, 10785, '<td valign="top">A nice choice for subject here. I think this is really underexposed though. There are no highlights to be found. You could have done one of three things here to get a better result... increase ISO, increase your shutter speed, or increase your aperture opening. I think you chose a good fstop becasue the shot has good focus and that''s what you want for most architecture shots. So increasing shutter or ISO would have been the way to go.</td>', 'A nice choice for subject here. I think this is really underexposed though. There are no highlights to be found. You could have done one of three things here to get a better result... increase ISO, increase your shutter speed, or increase your aperture opening. I think you chose a good fstop becasue the shot has good focus and that''s what you want for most architecture shots. So increasing shutter or ISO would have been the way to go.', '2012-08-15 15:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842225, 1029420, 10785, '<td valign="top">Love the blueness of this image and nice job with the exposure! I think you could have cloned out the two white lights in the sky and possibly cleaned up a bit of the reflected light in the river on the left under the cityscape. As well as the reflected light on the right of the bridge about a third of the way in from the left...</td>', 'Love the blueness of this image and nice job with the exposure! I think you could have cloned out the two white lights in the sky and possibly cleaned up a bit of the reflected light in the river on the left under the cityscape. As well as the reflected light on the right of the bridge about a third of the way in from the left...', '2012-08-15 15:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842226, 1029664, 10785, '<td valign="top">Super-funny!!! Should have shot from down low looking up and rotated so the commode was more on a 45 degree angle to you. Would have added that "strength" of an architecture shot!</td>', 'Super-funny!!! Should have shot from down low looking up and rotated so the commode was more on a 45 degree angle to you. Would have added that "strength" of an architecture shot!', '2012-08-15 16:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842228, 1029830, 114225, '<td valign="top">The clouds are really what I like most about this photo. They help enhance the bridge nicely.</td>', 'The clouds are really what I like most about this photo. They help enhance the bridge nicely.', '2012-08-15 16:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842229, 1029841, 114225, '<td valign="top">A good use of blue tones to pull in details in the stone.</td>', 'A good use of blue tones to pull in details in the stone.', '2012-08-15 16:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842230, 1029147, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Looks kinda like a giant rubbicks cube :)</td>', 'Very cool. Looks kinda like a giant rubbicks cube :)', '2012-08-15 16:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842231, 1029844, 114225, '<td valign="top">Blue creates a wonderful highlight to this photo.</td>', 'Blue creates a wonderful highlight to this photo.', '2012-08-15 16:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842232, 1029765, 10785, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and choice of subject! I like the more muted tones here, but perhaps you could have pushed the black point a little more to create some more contrast. I am just guessing that the histogram is a bit centered here with not many clipped tones on the left.</td>', 'Wonderful composition and choice of subject! I like the more muted tones here, but perhaps you could have pushed the black point a little more to create some more contrast. I am just guessing that the histogram is a bit centered here with not many clipped tones on the left.', '2012-08-15 16:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842234, 1029431, 114225, '<td valign="top">What an interesting use of lines and curves.</td>', 'What an interesting use of lines and curves.', '2012-08-15 16:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842235, 1029656, 114225, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful choice in color for a normally drab building.</td>', 'What a wonderful choice in color for a normally drab building.', '2012-08-15 16:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842236, 1029409, 114225, '<td valign="top">Those little slits of blue do catch the eye nicely.</td>', 'Those little slits of blue do catch the eye nicely.', '2012-08-15 16:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842245, 1029677, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is a cool repeating view. Makes the viewer wonder how far this extends on both sides.</td>', 'This is a cool repeating view. Makes the viewer wonder how far this extends on both sides.', '2012-08-15 16:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842246, 1029766, 114225, '<td valign="top">Those are some bold colors on those buildings, even the white one seems bold. The man with the bag is somewhat distracting.</td>', 'Those are some bold colors on those buildings, even the white one seems bold. The man with the bag is somewhat distracting.', '2012-08-15 16:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842247, 1029807, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. Great use of shadows to give shades to the blue.</td>', 'Very nicely done. Great use of shadows to give shades to the blue.', '2012-08-15 16:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842248, 1029343, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool. I like that that sky also has the aqua tint to it.</td>', 'Very cool. I like that that sky also has the aqua tint to it.', '2012-08-15 16:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842249, 1029217, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is a great capture of an intricate design.</td>', 'This is a great capture of an intricate design.', '2012-08-15 16:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842250, 1029806, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great use of lines in this.</td>', 'Great use of lines in this.', '2012-08-15 16:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842252, 1029825, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy how the sky works together with the slots, and the rest of the building works with the ground. Gives kind of a vertical symmetry.</td>', 'I really enjoy how the sky works together with the slots, and the rest of the building works with the ground. Gives kind of a vertical symmetry.', '2012-08-15 16:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6842254, 1029660, 114225, '<td valign="top">Fantastic use of light. Makes the building feel magical.</td>', 'Fantastic use of light. Makes the building feel magical.', '2012-08-15 16:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
