(6842256, 1029702, 114225, '<td valign="top">Gosh, I bet in color this is amazing. With the blue duo-tone, it feels like it lost some of the charm.</td>', 'Gosh, I bet in color this is amazing. With the blue duo-tone, it feels like it lost some of the charm.', '2012-08-15 16:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
