es. I have been suspended from these activities until 11/23/2012 So until then I am afraid I will be suspended in a sort of limbo here. Thanks to Amanda my dear friend who agreed to place this message from me on the members forum. Sincere regards all Fred', '2012-08-23 04:38:34.000000', '2012-08-23 04:40:02.000000', 0),
