(6848798, 1029287, 69008, '<td valign="top">That''s a cool looking bridge, but there''s nothing here that grabs my attention. It might have helped to shoot the bridge from a POV on the other side of the roadway, so that the curve would bring the bridge into the shot instead of having it curve away from the center. <br/>Generally, photos that are this dark overall do not score high in voting.  <br/>The boat is a nice addition, though it detracts from the bridge being the focal point of the image. The boat is what I want to look at in this one. <br/>You''re off to a pretty good start here at DPC.  I look fwd to seeing more of your photos.</td>', 'That''s a cool looking bridge, but there''s nothing here that grabs my attention. It might have helped to shoot the bridge from a POV on the other side of the roadway, so that the curve would bring the bridge into the shot instead of having it curve away from the center. Generally, photos that are this dark overall do not score high in voting.  The boat is a nice addition, though it detracts from the bridge being the focal point of the image. The boat is what I want to look at in this one. You''re off to a pretty good start here at DPC.  I look fwd to seeing more of your photos.', '2012-08-25 13:14:58.000000', NULL, 0),
